<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>cut-and-sew</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/cut-and-sew.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/polos.css">
</head>

<body>
     <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    <section class="hero-section">
        <div class="hero-bg-container">
            <img src="../photos/dyeing-processes.webp" alt="Vito and Will folded polo shirts" class="hero-image">
        </div>

    </section>
    <section class="manufacturing-services">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Custom Fabric & Garment Dyeing Services</h2>

            <p class="section-text">
                Textile dyeing is not as simple as it looks—it’s a delicate process that requires precision, expertise,
                and advanced technology. At Wuzwear Industry, we ensure that every stage of custom fabric and garment
                dyeing is carried out under strict supervision to deliver flawless results. Our process guarantees
                uniformity, color durability, and high-quality finishes that make your garments stand out.


            </p>

            <p class="section-text">
                Whether you are looking for tie-dyed T-shirts, dip-dyed hoodies, neon-dyed jackets, or yarn-dyed polos,
                our professional team and modern machinery can transform your ideas into reality.


            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="services-section">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="service-row">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/dyeing-processes1.webp" alt="Close up of hands using a sewing machine">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Dedicated Team for Professional Clothes Dyeing</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        We take pride in offering reliable and accurate dyeing services backed by our specialized
                        production team. Using advanced machinery such as jet circulation, drum-type dyers, and paddle
                        dyeing devices, we ensure consistency in every batch. To maintain quality, we conduct thorough
                        colorfastness tests before shipment—including detergent washing, crocking, perspiration,
                        sunlight, and water resistance tests. This ensures that your garments retain their vibrancy even
                        after repeated use.
                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-row row-reverse">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/dyeing-processes2.webp" alt="Tailor working with denim fabric at a workbench">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Garment Dyeing for a Wide Range of Apparel</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        Our dyeing services are available for an extensive variety of apparel, including T-shirts, polo
                        shirts, hoodies, jackets, jeans, caps, sweatshirts, and more. While fabrics like cotton, linen,
                        silk, rayon, and nylon often provide the best dyeing results, our team is always available to
                        guide you through the best material choices for your collection.
                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="dye-services-section">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="dye-row">
                <div class="dye-image">
                    <img src="../photos/dyeing-processes3.webp" alt="Colorful sublimated and dyed athletic t-shirts">
                </div>
                <div class="dye-content">
                    <h2 class="dye-title">Direct Color Dye</h2>
                    <p class="dye-text">
                        This method is perfect for startups and small brands. With a minimum of just 100 pieces, we can
                        match your exact Pantone color digitally to achieve the shade you require. Although direct
                        dyeing is not as rich as reactive dyeing, it is ideal when your focus is on unique colors with
                        low order quantities.
                    </p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="dye-row row-reverse">
                <div class="dye-image">
                    <img src="../photos/dyeing-processes4'.webp"
                        alt="A collection of vibrant fabric color swatches arranged together">
                </div>
                <div class="dye-content">
                    <h2 class="dye-title">Reactive Color Dye</h2>
                    <p class="dye-text">
                        Reactive dyeing ensures long-lasting, premium results that do not fade even after repeated
                        washes or exposure to sunlight. This process involves knitting fabric from scratch in your
                        chosen blend and requires a minimum of 800 pieces. It is the preferred option for established
                        brands seeking high-quality, permanent colors.
                    </p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="services-section">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="service-row">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/dyeing-processes5.webp" alt="Close up of hands using a sewing machine">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Dip Dye</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        If you want garments with a gradient or multicolor look, dip dyeing is the right choice. With a
                        minimum of just 50 pieces, this process creates unique shading effects that add character and
                        depth to your apparel.


                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-row row-reverse">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/dyeing-processes6.webp" alt="Tailor working with denim fabric at a workbench">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Neon Dyeing</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        For brands that want to stand out, neon dyeing gives garments a special glowing effect. This
                        method uses advanced dyeing chemicals and can be combined with glow-in-the-dark printing for an
                        even bolder result.


                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="service-row">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/dyeing-processes7.webp" alt="Close up of hands using a sewing machine">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Sulphate Dyeing</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        Sulphate dyeing is ideal for creating vintage and washed-out effects. Whether you want garments
                        that fade, lose color intentionally, or feature an inside-out effect, this process delivers the
                        perfect distressed look.


                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>
    </section>
    


    <%- include('partials/popup') %>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>